flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:50:27.2950988Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:50:27.2951064Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:50:27.2951182Z 
